<notes>
- V9's spec says "in range" but gives no bounds. I assumed an inclusive 0–100 range and put it in `RELIABILITY_MIN` / `RELIABILITY_MAX` so it is easy to change. Please confirm the real range.
- V8 matches expiries to notices on the exact `[sku, wh, qty]` triple, as a multiset. Each expired item needs its own matching notice. If notices should match on `(sku, wh)` alone, or the spec allows a different quantity, the check needs changing.
- V7 treats `max_units == capacity` as respected. Only `max_units > capacity` fails.
